ns slaughtered in the United States, claim officials in Brussels, are not fit to grace European tables.","start":16.84,"end":23.88,"score":0.92,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-003","sourceId":"b4-008-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"No, say the Americans: our fowl are fine, we simply clean them in a different way.","start":25.08,"end":31.47,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-004","sourceId":"b4-008-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"These days, it is differences in national regulations, far more than tariffs, that put sand in the wheels of trade between rich countries.","start":32.59,"end":41.94,"score":0.914,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-005","sourceId":"b4-008-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It is not just farmers who are complaining.","start":43.04,"end":45.6,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-006-p01","sourceId":"b4-008-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"An electric razor that meets the European Union's safety standards must be approved by American testers before it can be sold in the United States,","start":46.48,"end":56.35,"score":0.949,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-006-p02","sourceId":"b4-008-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[25,41],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and an American-made dialysis machine needs the EU's okay before it hits the market in Europe.","start":57.19,"end":64.34,"score":0.929,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-007","sourceId":"b4-008-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"As it happens, a razor that is safe in Europe is unlikely to electrocute Americans.","start":65.663,"end":71.47,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-008","sourceId":"b4-008-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"So, ask businesses on both sides of the Atlantic, why have two lots of tests where one would do?","start":72.14,"end":79.54,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-009-p01","sourceId":"b4-008-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Politicians agree, in principle, so America and the EU have been trying to reach a deal","start":80.74,"end":87.35,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-009-p02","sourceId":"b4-008-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[16,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"which would eliminate the need to double-test many products.","start":87.56,"end":91.25,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-010","sourceId":"b4-008-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"They hope to finish in time for a trade summit between America and the EU on May 28th.","start":92.42,"end":98.64,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-011","sourceId":"b4-008-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Although negotiators are optimistic, the details are complex enough that they may be hard-pressed to get a deal at all.","start":99.41,"end":106.85,"score":0.978,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-012","sourceId":"b4-008-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,1],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Why?","start":107.82,"end":108.43,"score":0.958,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-013","sourceId":"b4-008-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"One difficulty is to construct the agreements.","start":108.92,"end":111.77,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-014-p01","sourceId":"b4-008-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The Americans would happily reach one accord on standards for medical devices and then hammer out different pacts covering, say,","start":112.64,"end":120.243,"score":0.952,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-014-p02","sourceId":"b4-008-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[20,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"electronic goods and drug manufacturing.","start":120.45,"end":123.2,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-008-015-p01","sourceId":"b4-008-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The EU -- following fine continental traditions -- wants agreement on general principles,","start":124.21,"end":130.51,"score":0.905,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["low-word-confidence"]},{"id":"b4-008-015-p02","sourceId":"b4-008-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[11,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"which could be applied to many types of products and perhaps extended to other countries.","start":130.88,"end":136.0,"score":0.994,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
